```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant C as Client (WebRTC)
    participant V as VAD
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant M as AI Pipeline (LLM/TTS)
    
    O->>C: Streaming TTS Audio (Turn N)
    C->>U: Plays Audio
    
    U->>C: Starts speaking (Barge-in)
    C->>V: Audio frames
    V->>O: Event: Speech Detected!
    
    Note over O,M: Handle Interruption
    O->>M: Cancel Generation (Turn N)
    O->>C: Stop TTS Playback
    
    C->>U: Audio stops
    
    V->>O: Audio frames (User Query)
    O->>M: Process Turn N+1
    M->>O: Streaming Response (Turn N+1)
    O->>C: Streaming TTS Audio (Turn N+1)
    C->>U: Plays New Audio
```
